# Working in this repository

## Style

- Keep functions small and pure: no I/O, no global state.
- Every public function has type hints and a one-line docstring.
- Prefer plain `if` statements over clever one-liners when it reads better.
- Keep each change focused on one fix; unrelated cleanups go in their own change.

{agents_slot}

## Tests

Run `python -m pytest` from the repository root. No install step is needed.
Add or update a test in `tests/` for every behaviour change.
